{"id":"6b648ff230619ba2","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-configuration-transition.md","title":"One-Step Configuration Transition","display":"df-configuration-transition — One-Step Configuration Transition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-configuration-transition","aliases":["28-df-configuration-transition"],"display":"df-configuration-transition — One-Step Configuration Transition","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-ntm]]","[[28-df-configuration]]"],"source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"13,41–42","source_pdf_pages":"39,67–68"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-configuration-transition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-configuration-transition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-configuration-transition — One-Step Configuration Transition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e6357334ccd3589d\" href=\"?note=e6357334ccd3589d\" title=\"28-df-ntm\">28-df-ntm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"599727eea07e91d7\" href=\"?note=599727eea07e91d7\" title=\"28-df-configuration\">28-df-configuration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"13,41–42"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"39,67–68"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=k_M\">\\(k=k_M\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle,c&#39;=\\langle q&#39;,T&#39;,\\boldsymbol i&#39;\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M)\">\\(c=\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle,c&#39;=\\langle q&#39;,T&#39;,\\boldsymbol i&#39;\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M)\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"599727eea07e91d7\" href=\"?note=599727eea07e91d7\" title=\"28-df-configuration\">28-df-configuration</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol a\\in\\Gamma^k,\\ \\boldsymbol d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol a\\in\\Gamma^k,\\ \\boldsymbol d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_M\\)</span> 为待定义关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell(c)\\coloneqq\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:T_0(j)=\\rhd\\}-1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell(c)\\coloneqq\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:T_0(j)=\\rhd\\}-1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Step}_M(c,c&#39;)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ {}&amp;q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\land\\exists\\boldsymbol a\\in\\Gamma^k\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1}\\;\\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;((M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land\\delta(q,(T_j(i_j))_{j=0}^k)=(q&#39;,\\boldsymbol a,\\boldsymbol d))\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\land(q&#39;,\\boldsymbol a,\\boldsymbol d)\\in\\delta(q,(T_j(i_j))_{j=0}^k)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land T&#39;_0=T_0\\land i&#39;_0=\\min\\{\\ell(c)+1,\\max\\{0,i_0+d_0\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(i&#39;_j=\\max\\{0,i_j+d_j\\}\\land T&#39;_j(i_j)=a_j\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{i_j\\}\\;T&#39;_j(b)=T_j(b))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Step}_M(c,c&#39;)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ {}&amp;q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\land\\exists\\boldsymbol a\\in\\Gamma^k\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1}\\;\\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;((M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land\\delta(q,(T_j(i_j))_{j=0}^k)=(q&#39;,\\boldsymbol a,\\boldsymbol d))\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\land(q&#39;,\\boldsymbol a,\\boldsymbol d)\\in\\delta(q,(T_j(i_j))_{j=0}^k)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land T&#39;_0=T_0\\land i&#39;_0=\\min\\{\\ell(c)+1,\\max\\{0,i_0+d_0\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(i&#39;_j=\\max\\{0,i_j+d_j\\}\\land T&#39;_j(i_j)=a_j\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{i_j\\}\\;T&#39;_j(b)=T_j(b))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>输入长度从配置只读带唯一的右端标记位置恢复，故Step只依赖已写入签名的M,c,c′；允许在Conf(M)的全输入并集中调用。显式排除停机状态，因此有限计算前缀不会在停机配置后无界延长；只读输入无写入分量。两类转移的函数值/集合成员关系分别使用，不把非确定转移误写成函数单值。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§1.2，印刷 p.13 / PDF p.39；§2.1.2，原书非确定选择的局部适配。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ntm","status":"resolved","id":"e6357334ccd3589d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ntm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"599727eea07e91d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"599727eea07e91d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，$k=k_M$。$c=\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle,c'=\\langle q',T',\\boldsymbol i'\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M)$，see [[28-df-configuration]]。\n$\\boldsymbol a\\in\\Gamma^k,\\ \\boldsymbol d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1}$；$\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 为待定义关系。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}","display":false},{"tex":"k=k_M","display":false},{"tex":"c=\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle,c'=\\langle q',T',\\boldsymbol i'\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol a\\in\\Gamma^k,\\ \\boldsymbol d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(c)\\coloneqq\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:T_0(j)=\\rhd\\}-1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Step}_M(c,c')\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ {}&q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\land\\exists\\boldsymbol a\\in\\Gamma^k\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1}\\;\\bigl[\\\\\n&((M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land\\delta(q,(T_j(i_j))_{j=0}^k)=(q',\\boldsymbol a,\\boldsymbol d))\\\\\n&\\lor(M\\in\\mathrm{NTM}\\land(q',\\boldsymbol a,\\boldsymbol d)\\in\\delta(q,(T_j(i_j))_{j=0}^k)))\\\\\n&\\land T'_0=T_0\\land i'_0=\\min\\{\\ell(c)+1,\\max\\{0,i_0+d_0\\}\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(i'_j=\\max\\{0,i_j+d_j\\}\\land T'_j(i_j)=a_j\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{i_j\\}\\;T'_j(b)=T_j(b))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2179,"backlinks":[{"id":"9efd20f439611336","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，$k=k_M$；$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),I_x$ 与 $\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 来自 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]。\n$\\rho=(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)$ 为非空有限配置序列，$\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)=m$ 表示转移步数，$\\operatorname{last}(\\rho)=C_m$；$C.q$ 为配置的状态投影。"},{"id":"1b4d0bd43db4c9c9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，$k=k_M$，$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$b=s(|x|)$。\n$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 来自 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]；$\\boldsymbol b=(b_1,\\ldots,b_k)$ 为每带可访问初始区间长度。"},{"id":"91b637dbdbd7a2c3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$k=k_M$；初始配置 $C^0_{M,x}$ 见 [[28-df-computation]]，一步关系 $\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 见 [[28-df-configuration-transition]]。$q(C)$、$i_j(C)$ 分别为配置的状态和第 $j$ 个头位置投影；$0\\le j\\le k$。下式按 $t\\in\\mathbb N$ 定义停机后吸收延拓的执行和头位置函数。"},{"id":"3e7207510b515565","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$ 为预言机；$\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 见 [[28-df-configuration-transition]]。"},{"id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N=(M_0,M_1)$ 为两台共享 $Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}$ 和带数、仅转移函数可不同的确定型机。$\\operatorname{Step}_{M_b}$、初始配置 $C^0_{M_0,x}$ 分别见 [[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-computation]]；$C.q$ 是状态投影，$C.T_1$ 是输出工作带投影，$\\operatorname{out}$ 见 [[28-df-machine-resources]]。$\\mathsf{RTM}$、$C_t^N$、$T_N$、$O_N$ 由下式定义。"},{"id":"8330fa9041fa77ae","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\operatorname{Conf}$、$I_x$、$\\operatorname{Step}$ 分别见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]。"},{"id":"ed85cd72838ef590","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$k=k_M$，见 [[28-df-tm]]。$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)$、$\\operatorname{Step}_M$、$C^0_{M,x}$、$\\operatorname{out}$ 依次见 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-computation]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"语言与停机语义：[[28-df-language]]、[[28-df-decider]]、[[28-df-recognizer]]、[[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-ntm]]、[[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-configuration-graph]]、[[28-df-computation]]。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","e6357334ccd3589d","599727eea07e91d7"]}